Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: qcom: asus-flo: move the passive CPU trip to 85 C

The board idles around 60 C and reaches the default 75 C passive trip
during ordinary scrolling, so the CPUs would be throttled in normal use.
Two minutes of full load on four cores settle at 80-86 C with a cap at
that level.

--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/qcom/qcom-apq8064-asus-nexus7-flo.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/qcom/qcom-apq8064-asus-nexus7-flo.dts
@@ -433,3 +433,20 @@
 		vdddig-supply = <&pm8921_lvs2>;
 	};
 };
+
+/* The tablet idles around 60 C; start throttling well above that. */
+&cpu_alert0 {
+	temperature = <85000>;
+};
+
+&cpu_alert1 {
+	temperature = <85000>;
+};
+
+&cpu_alert2 {
+	temperature = <85000>;
+};
+
+&cpu_alert3 {
+	temperature = <85000>;
+};
